                "lookup_hardcoded": "artillery_projectile_calibration_target_area;;;;;area of calibration target in square metres:::::bayonet_melee_attack_bonus;;;;;Using bayonets increases the attack stat of a unit:::::bayonet_ring_reload_time_penalty;;;;;Using Ring bayonets increases the time needed to reload the musket/carbine:::::land_mortar_projectile_calibration_target_area;;;;;area of calibration target in square metres:::::magazine_explosion_interrupt_chance;;;;;% chance of ship magazine exploding once a hit registers:::::misfire_cannon_flintlock;;;;;Misfire of a cannon with matchlock:::::misfire_cannon_matchlock;;;;;Misfire of a cannon with matchlock:::::misfire_musket_flintlock;;;;;Misfire of a musket with flintlock:::::misfire_musket_matchlock;;;;;Misfire of a musket with matchlock ( 0.2 means a 20% chance of misfire):::::misfire_musket_percussion_cap;;;;;Misfire of a musket with percussion cap:::::missile_distance_for_half_chance_hit;;;;;Projectile system: infantry calibration distance at which marksmanship = chance to hit calibration target:::::missile_distance_for_half_chance_hit_artillery;;;;;Projectile system: artillery calibration distance at which marksmanship = chance to hit calibration target.:::::missile_distance_for_half_chance_hit_naval;;;;;Projectile system: naval gun calibration distance at which marksmanship = chance to hit calibration target.:::::naval_projectile_calibration_target_area;;;;;area of calibration target in square metres:::::projectile_calibration_target_area;;;;;area of calibration target in square metres:::::projectile_damage_armour_divisor;;;;;Projectile rule system: divisor for armour stat subtraction from kill chance:::::projectile_damage_defense_divisor;;;;;Projectile rule system: divisor for defence stat subtraction from kill chance:::::projectile_damage_distance_multiplier;;;;;Projectile rule system: multiplier applied to distance/range for subtraction from kill chance:::::projectile_damage_shield_divisor;;;;;Projectile rule system: divisor for shield stat subtraction from kill chance:::::projectile_incendiary_chance_high;;;;;Projectile_rule_system: chance to cause fire on hit (divide by # of fragments):::::projectile_incendiary_chance_low;;;;;Projectile_rule_system: chance to cause fire on hit (divide by # of fragments):::::projectile_incendiary_chance_medium;;;;;Projectile_rule_system: chance to cause fire on hit (divide by # of fragments)",
            },
        },
